---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
    title="Home Physiotherapy in Faridabad | Neriva Health" 
    description="Professional home physiotherapy sessions in Faridabad. Ideal for elderly, post-operative, and mobility-limited patients."
>
    <section class="section-padding" style="margin-top: 4rem;">
        <div class="container">
            <h1 style="margin-bottom: 1.5rem; color: var(--primary-blue);">Home Physiotherapy in Faridabad</h1>
            <p style="font-size: 1.125rem; color: var(--text-light); max-width: 800px; line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 3rem;">
                We understand that traveling to a clinic isn't always possible. Dr. Abhishek Kumar brings professional, evidence-based physiotherapy directly to your home across Faridabad.
            </p>

            <div style="background: var(--bg-light); padding: 2.5rem; border-radius: 0.5rem; margin-bottom: 4rem;">
                <h2 style="margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">Who Benefits from Home Visits?</h2>
                <ul style="list-style-type: disc; margin-left: 1.5rem; color: var(--text-light); line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 2rem;">
                    <li>Elderly patients with severe joint pain or arthritis</li>
                    <li>Patients recovering from orthopedic surgeries (Knee/Hip Replacement)</li>
                    <li>Individuals with neurological conditions (Stroke, Paralysis)</li>
                    <li>Patients in acute pain who are unable to travel</li>
                </ul>

                <h2 style="margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">What to Expect</h2>
                <p style="color: var(--text-light); line-height: 1.8;">
                    During a home visit, we perform the same rigorous assessment as in our clinic. We bring the necessary portable equipment and create a rehabilitation environment within your home to ensure safe, effective therapy.
                </p>
            </div>

            <h2 style="margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">Book a Home Visit</h2>
            <p style="margin-bottom: 1.5rem; color: var(--text-light);">Contact us to check availability for your area in Faridabad.</p>
            <a href="https://wa.me/919650940281?text=Hi,%20I%20would%20like%20to%20inquire%20about%20home%20physiotherapy%20visits." target="_blank" class="btn btn-accent" style="margin-right: 1rem;">Chat on WhatsApp</a>
            <a href="tel:9650940281" class="btn btn-primary">Call Clinic</a>
        </div>
    </section>
</Layout>
